# Repo-root `*.png` (.gitignore:35) masks tranche evidence—`git add` silently drops
# all 10 OD-1 union-screenshots (incl. the PRT defect proof, prt-light-held-board.png).
# This negation re-includes every PNG under docs/tranches/; it rides the tranche commit.
# W0 preserves it when re-anchoring the root globs (2026-07-grand-uplift/waves/W0-build-restoration.md).
!**/*.png
